  "is_special_feature": true,
  "review": "<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50/80 via-white to-orange-50/60 border border-amber-200/90 rounded-3xl shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n    <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-600 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full shadow-2xs\">栃木県・京都府・長野県 厳選ガイド</span>\n    <span class=\"text-xs text-stone-500 font-bold\">楽天トラベル公式データ連携・2026最新</span>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"text-sm text-stone-800 leading-relaxed font-medium\">秋が深まる10月・11月、日本の山々は燃えるような赤や黄金色に包まれます。露天風呂に浸かりながら色鮮やかな木々を愛でる「紅葉露天」は、秋の旅の醍醐味。日光・那須の渓谷美から、京都の奥座敷の風情ある庭園紅葉まで、美しく染まる大自然を特等席で眺められる名旅館を特集します。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2.5 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">\n  🍁 紅葉露天を満喫する3つのポイント\n</h2>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 my-6\">\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/80 border border-amber-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-1.5 text-amber-950\">\n      <span class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-white text-stone-800 text-xs flex items-center justify-center font-black shadow-2xs\">1</span>\n      水面に浮かぶ紅葉の葉と錦秋のパノラマ\n    </h4>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">湯船に映り込む秋の色合いと、秋風に揺れる木々のざわめきに癒やされる時間。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/80 border border-amber-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-1.5 text-amber-950\">\n      <span class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-white text-stone-800 text-xs flex items-center justify-center font-black shadow-2xs\">2</span>\n      夜の紅葉ライトアップ鑑賞\n    </h4>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">闇夜に浮かび上がる幻想的な紅葉庭園や渓谷のライトアップを客室やロビーから鑑賞。</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/80 border border-amber-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-1.5 text-amber-950\">\n      <span class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-white text-stone-800 text-xs flex items-center justify-center font-black shadow-2xs\">3</span>\n      秋の恵みを取り入れた季節会席\n    </h4>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">松茸、新米、戻りカツオ、秋鮭など、実りの秋ならではの美食ディナー。</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2.5 my-8 flex items-center gap-2\">\n  🏨 楽天トラベルで高評価！おすすめの厳選宿泊施設\n</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 md:p-7 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-md space-y-5\">\n  <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-100 pb-3 gap-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-white bg-amber-600 px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-2xs\">第1位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">\n        日光東照宮晃陽苑\n      </h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg\">⭐ 4.01 (311件の口コミ)</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-5 items-start\">\n    <div class=\"md:col-span-5\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/168189/168189.jpg\" alt=\"日光東照宮晃陽苑\" class=\"w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-xs\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <p class=\"text-2xs text-stone-500 mt-2 bg-stone-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-stone-200/70 leading-relaxed font-medium\">💡 4万坪（東京D約2個半）の敷地の中に、四季折々の自然とゆったりと時間を感じられる日光東照宮ゆかりの宿</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"md:col-span-7 space-y-3.5 text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">\n      <p><strong>📍 所在地:</strong> 栃木県 日光市瀬尾1640-14</p>\n      <p><strong>🚗 アクセス:</strong> 日光駅よりお車にて約１０分</p>\n      <p><strong>🅿️ 駐車場:</strong> 有り（無料）　１００台　予約不要</p>\n      <p><strong>💰 最安目安料金:</strong> <span class=\"text-sm font-extrabold text-orange-600\">¥12,705〜</span> （1名あたり / 税込）</p>\n\n      <div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/50 border border-amber-200/80 text-xs text-stone-800 space-y-